      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo yarumbula akobunyali bwobukhalabanibwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa isie Paulo omwene emusaaya khulwa obuholo nende eshisa shiaKristo; isie oumwongolelanga nindi halala nineenywe, ne nihumaho ninyuma ikholo khwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toto mwene, emusaaya; mbu olwa emba nindiho nineenywe endeshe okhumuumila ikholo. Ne endi ninayo khulwa obwisiichi obumbeelesia itswoni okhufukula abo abakhupaarangakhwo mbu khuchenda mumela yomubili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila kata nikhuchendanga mumubili, shikhuseerelanga lihe mumela yomubili ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba ebimanulwa bieefwe bielihe shibili ebieshinamubili ta, ne nebiobunyali imbeli waNyasaye khulwa okhulikulula tsingoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulikululanga amayinje, nende buli shindu eshili hekulu, eshichinguukha okhufukula obumanyi bwaNyasaye, nikhuhamba buli liyililisio imbambe mbu lihulilenje Iiristo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne khwirecheeshe okhukuuma obukhayi bwosi, olwa obuhulili bweenywe bulaba nibumalile okhwikhola obulamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henje akali hambeli weenywe. Omundu nalebe niyeesuubilanga mbu nowaKristo, ayililisiekhwo khandi mumwoyokwe, mbu shinga ye olwa ali owaKristo, nineefwe fwesi khuli khurio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kata nindakhaba nindiyitsiala okhushilaasiakhwo khumakhuwa kobunyali obwa khwaheebwa, obwa Omwami yahaana khulwa okhumuumbakha, nikhurali okhulikulula ta, shindalafwimbwa omurwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shinzenya okhumuloleshela shinga owenya okhumuriisia netsibarwa tsianje ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba baboola mbu Tsibarwatsie netsisiro, etsiamaani; ne naliho omwene, mumubilikwe, shialikhwo namaani ta, kata okhuboolakhwe nokhwabutswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouboola ario yeetsulile likhuwa lino, mbu shinga olwa khuli mumasungo akomutsibarwa ifwe abeene nikhubulaho, nolwa khandi khuli mubikhole, abeene olwa khuliho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila shikhutsaalikha okhwibasia kata okhwichelasia abeene nende abandi khubo abeepaaka abeene, ta; ne bo abeene, abeechelasia abeene khubeene, nibeepiima abeene khubeene, babula obuchesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa ifwe shikhuleeyitsiala okhubira eshichelo shieefwe ta; nishio eshichelo shiolwakho olwa Nyasaye yakhukabila lube eshichelo, mbu okhuula kata khwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba ifwe shikhwinyiilanga muno muno shinga abaranyala okhuula ewa muli, ta; shichila nifwe abaranjilila okhuula ewa muli, munjiili yaKristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata shikhuleeyitsiala okhubira eshichelo shieefwe ta, eshisina mbu muminyakhano chiabandu bandi; nebutswa khunaayanga mbu, obusuubili bweenywe olwa bukhulanga, ifwe khulakaliyila mwinywe, olwakho Iweefwe shinga olwa luli, okhuula khukhushilaana khundi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu okhwilwatsa injiili kata mumbali etsili imbeli weenywe, obureeyitsialila amakhuwa akamalile okhukasibwa mulwakho Iwoundi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne owiyitsiala, yeeyitsialila muMwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila shiali oyo owipaaka omwene oufuchiililwa ta, habula oyo owa Omwami apaaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
